{"author":"Unknown","author_email":"","data":{"content_hash":"eb1c625da8127398680f43df043f688be2be1a07ab9d99a86b8b18f1d068db6a","digest":{"component_or_area":"plan-review gate drift-refresh mechanism","key_entities":["progressive_drift_refresh","src/rebar/_config_schema.py","src/rebar/llm/plan_review/__init__.py","docs/config.md","docs/plan-review-gate.md","docs/adr/0002-code-drift-invalidation.md","VerifyConfig.progressive_drift_refresh","E4+G1G2 criteria scope","drift-only-stale re-review","full re-review fallback path"],"problem_keywords":["plan-review attestation staleness","code drift invalidation","re-review instability","progressive drift-refresh","scoped grounding probe","default configuration","credential refresh"],"propositions":["When main advances, signed plan-review attestations read stale and trigger full re-reviews on byte-identical plans, exposing them to the measured 32% verdict instability that the convergence floors do not cover.","Progressive drift-refresh (existing design, currently default OFF) runs a scoped E4+G1G2 grounding probe to validate stale attestations and refreshes them without re-sampling the full criteria set, preventing false findings from non-drift sources.","Enabling progressive_drift_refresh by default reduces agent-tier LLM calls from ~8-12 to exactly 2 per drift-only-stale re-review, yielding approximately 75-83% fewer agent-criterion calls with proportional token/latency saving while preserving correctness via full re-review fallback.","The configuration flag progressive_drift_refresh must default to True, with explicit False restoring the full re-review path for backward compatibility and testing the off-path behavior.","All default-OFF framing and opt-in language for drift-refresh in source, tests, and documentation must be swept and replaced with default-ON statements, dated with operator authorization (2026-07-12)."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b2b5c498-2f67-4ae3-bafc-eca40294bec2","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1785713976705078632,"uuid":"b46b20f5-e3d9-4097-a2f9-66029292c7b1"}